                                "sense_id": "60aa08d0-068c-3b40-bf56-8867bb555ad9",
                                "text": "1791, William Cowper (translator), The Odyssey of Homer, Book 19, in The Poetical Works of William Cowper, London: William Smith, 1839, p. 492,\n[…] I shall fix,\nThis day, the rings for trial to them all\nOf archership;"
